--- startup: options, defaults, and the same options for b twice
init: who=luish
init: times=1
init: loud=true
HELLO, luish
rhai: luish i64 2 bool true false
b: level 2
a
c
post-rc: luish
after: unset
hi, luish
--- the startup cache restores the options
rhai: luish i64 2 bool true false
after: unset
hi, luish
--- savestate records them
__luish_internal plugin restore 'greet' '~/.config/luish/plugins/greet' 'who=world' 'times=3' 'loud=false'
--- plugin load: OPTION=VALUE after each plugin, as the types declared
init: who=sh
init: times=-2
init: loud=true
HELLO, sh
rhai: sh i64 -1 bool true false
plain: 0 options
b: level 7
--- inconsistent options for a dependency
luish: ~/src/coll/c/plugin.toml: line 2: coll/b: inconsistent options: level = 3 here, but level = 2 for coll/a
init: who=luish
init: times=1
init: loud=true
HELLO, luish
rhai: luish i64 2 bool true false
b: level 2
a
post-rc: luish
--- the defaults count: no options is level = 0
luish: ~/src/coll/c/plugin.toml: line 2: coll/b: inconsistent options: level = 0 here, but level = 2 for coll/a
init: who=luish
init: times=1
init: loud=true
HELLO, luish
rhai: luish i64 2 bool true false
b: level 2
a
--- a plugin loaded already, with other options
luish: 2: __luish_internal plugin: coll/b: inconsistent options: level = 2 here, but loaded with level = 1 (plugin unload coll/b first)
    __luish_internal plugin load coll/a; echo "status $?"
status 1
same
after unload
